## Summary

Add minimal dopemux init scaffolding under src/dopemux/templates/init/: a thin .github/workflows/pr-steward.yml and embedded-audit.yml (which just call the console command), a small config/pr_steward/, and config/pr_merge_specialist/policy.yaml (governed_automerge OFF). Verify dopemux init and init --force provision them without clobbering existing files.

## Scope

Allowlist-bound; see commit.allowlist. Out of scope: Do not add a heavy setup subcommand or checksum manifest (deferred, YAGNI). Do not add a reusable composite GitHub Action (deferred). Do not overwrite existing repo files on init.

## Validation

See commit.verify; embedded audit + proof bundle required.

